    "The rates below are not our projections. They are the published price lists of two working operators, a mobile pub in Ohio and a mobile coffee bar in Alberta, converted at $1 = €0.92. We do not model at that rate: every figure on the unit pages uses €1,450, our middle estimate for a European diary, which is below what these two charge.": "Cene ispod nisu naše projekcije. To su objavljeni cenovnici dva operatera koji rade, mobilnog paba u Ohaju i mobilnog kafe bara u Alberti, preračunato po kursu $1 = €0,92. Po toj ceni ne računamo: sve brojke na stranicama jedinica uzimaju €1.450, našu srednju procenu za evropski kalendar, a ona je ispod onoga što ova dvojica naplaćuju.",
