    "Can I tow it with the vehicle I already have?": "Mogu li da je vučem vozilom koje već imam?",
    "Both units are built within European towing dimensions, and the loaded weight is confirmed in writing before the build starts. You know which vehicle and which licence it needs before you commit to anything.": "Obe jedinice su u evropskim gabaritima za vuču, a ukupna masa se potvrđuje pismeno pre početka izrade. Koje vozilo i koja kategorija vam trebaju znate pre nego što se na bilo šta obavežete.",
