    "Mobile bars and coffee units · Tiny Mansion": "Mobilni barovi i kafe jedinice · Tiny Mansion",
    "A draft bar and an espresso bar on a trailer built to European towing dimensions, carrying your own brand. Delivered to your yard anywhere in the EU, with the economics written out.": "Točeni bar i espreso bar na prikolici u evropskim gabaritima za vuču, pod vašim imenom. Dostava do vašeg dvorišta bilo gde u EU, s ispisanim računom.",
    "Built to the same discipline as the residences, on a shorter chassis of its own and fitted out to serve. Within European towing dimensions, delivered to your pitch anywhere in the EU.": "Pravljeno jednako strogo kao rezidencije, na sopstvenoj kraćoj šasiji i opremljeno za posluživanje. U evropskim gabaritima za vuču, s dostavom do vaše lokacije bilo gde u EU.",
    "See the unit": "Pogledajte jedinicu",
    "Ask for a quotation": "Zatražite ponudu",
    "What is in it": "Šta je unutra",
    "Fitted with": "Opremljeno",
    "Draft & Craft Bar": "Draft & Craft Bar",
    "Beer, cider and wine on tap, cold from the first pour to the last.": "Pivo, sajder i vino s točilice, hladni od prve do poslednje krigle.",
    "A pouring bar built around a glycol line, so what comes out of the last tap at midnight is the same temperature as the first one at noon. Sized for a festival queue rather than a kitchen.": "Točeni bar sklopljen oko glikolne linije, da ono što u ponoć izađe iz poslednje točilice bude iste temperature kao prvo u podne. Dimenzionisan za festivalski red, a ne za kuhinju.",
    "Espresso & Cocktail Lounge": "Espresso & Cocktail Lounge",
    "Coffee in the morning, cocktails by the evening, one unit.": "Ujutru kafa, uveče kokteli, i sve to jedna jedinica.",
    "Two services in one trailer, because a wedding needs coffee at eleven and negronis at seven. The machine side and the bar station are separated so neither waits on the other.": "Dve usluge u jednoj prikolici, jer svadbi treba kafa u jedanaest i negroni u sedam. Strana s mašinom i barska stanica su razdvojene, da jedna ne čeka drugu.",
    "Taps": "Točilice",
