    "Cold": "Hladno",
    "Under-counter fridge and freezer": "Frižider i zamrzivač ispod pulta",
    "Glycol chiller and insulated python to every tap": "Glikolni rashladnik i izolovani pajton do svake točilice",
    "Refrigerated keg room with its own door": "Rashlađeni prostor za burad sa sopstvenim vratima",
    "Stainless pouring counter with a drip tray and rinser": "Točioni pult od nerđajućeg čelika s posudom za kapanje i ispiračem",
    "Under-counter bottle fridges": "Frižideri za flaše ispod pulta",
    "Glass wash sink and a separate hand-wash basin": "Sudopera za čaše i poseban lavabo za ruke",
    "Two-group espresso machine with a water treatment line": "Dvogrupna espreso mašina s linijom za pripremu vode",
    "Two on-demand grinders and a knock box": "Dva on-demand mlina i posuda za talog",
    "Professional bar station: speed rail, ice well, gastronorm inserts": "Profesionalna barska stanica: spid-rejl, posuda za led, gastro posude",
    "Under-counter refrigeration and a freezer drawer": "Hlađenje ispod pulta i fioka zamrzivača",
    "Blender and shaker station on a sound-damped worktop": "Blender i šejker stanica na radnoj ploči s prigušenjem zvuka",
    "A green public-house unit lettered in gold on a barrel roof, whiskey barrels and stools set out on the gravel beside it": "Zelena jedinica u stilu paba sa zlatnim natpisom na bačvastom krovu, burad viskija i stolice postavljene na šljunku pored nje",
    "A black and green Victorian bar unit with etched glass, brass fittings and a brick skirt, standing on a lane": "Crno-zelena barska jedinica u viktorijanskom stilu, s brušenim staklom, mesinganim okovom i ciglenom podnožnom trakom, na uličici",
    "A pale wine bar unit with a burgundy awning over the serving hatch, cases and a bottle rack behind the counter, vines behind it": "Svetla vinska jedinica s bordo tendom nad prozorom za izdavanje, gajbe i stalak za flaše iza šanka, vinogradi iza nje",
    "A weathered timber coffee unit under a curved roof, canvas awning rolled out over the hatch and two rattan stools at the counter": "Kafe jedinica od obrađenog drveta pod zaobljenim krovom, platnena tenda razvučena nad prozorom i dve ratan stolice uz šank",
    "A red barn-boarded unit with the serving hatch propped open and a timber counter run along the side": "Jedinica u crvenoj drvenoj oblozi s podignutim prozorom za izdavanje i drvenim šankom duž bočne strane",
    "A stone-clad serving unit lettered konoba, shuttered windows, herbs hung by the door, standing on its own trailer": "Jedinica za izdavanje u kamenoj oblozi s natpisom konoba, prozori sa škurama, bilje okačeno kraj vrata, na sopstvenoj prikolici",
    "A dark timber coffee unit lit from inside at dusk, the hatch open over a counter of coffee gear, snow and mountains behind it": "Kafe jedinica od tamnog drveta, osvetljena iznutra u sumrak, otvoren prozor nad šankom s kafe opremom, sneg i planine iza nje",
    "A dark timber coffee unit standing on snow at dusk, string lights along the eaves, a fire bowl and a sheepskin bench beside the steps": "Kafe jedinica od tamnog drveta na snegu u sumrak, lampioni duž strehe, vatreno ognjište i klupa s ovčjom kožom kraj stepenica",
    "The images are renders. Livery, timber and signwriting are drawn to a customer's own brief, which is what they are for; the chassis, the counter line and the equipment behind them are the specification below.": "Slike su renderi. Livreja, drvo i natpisi crtaju se po brifu naručioca, za to i služe; šasija, linija šanka i oprema iza njih idu po specifikaciji ispod.",
    "Inside the bar fitted out as a Victorian public house: dark green walls, a panelled back bar of glasses and bottles, a wood stove and a pew along one wall, with dimensions marked": "Unutrašnjost bara uređena kao viktorijanski pab: tamnozeleni zidovi, oblogom obložen zadnji šank s čašama i flašama, peć na drva i klupa uz jedan zid, s označenim merama",
    "The public-house counter seen along its length, tall stools at the front and the fitted back bar behind, with dimensions marked": "Šank paba u celoj dužini, visoke stolice ispred i ugrađeni zadnji šank iza, s označenim merama",
    "The same shell fitted out in white boarding: a zinc bar with two stools, a bench and table down one wall and a small wood stove": "Isti korpus uređen belom drvenom oblogom: cinkani šank s dve stolice, klupa i sto uz jedan zid i mala peć na drva",
    "The white fit-out with its dimensions marked: bar and stool heights, bench and table sizes, and the width of the working aisle": "Belo uređenje s označenim merama: visine šanka i stolica, dimenzije klupe i stola i širina radnog prolaza",
    "The coffee unit in mint green and cream under a striped awning, standing on a stone piazza with the hatch open and the machine visible inside": "Kafe jedinica u mentol zelenoj i krem boji pod prugastom tendom, na kamenom trgu, s otvorenim prozorom i mašinom koja se vidi unutra",
    "Inside the coffee unit in mint green and brass: counters down both sides, a herringbone splashback and the espresso machine at the open hatch, with dimensions marked": "Unutrašnjost kafe jedinice u mentol zelenoj i mesingu: pultovi s obe strane, zidna obloga u riblju kost i espreso mašina kod otvorenog prozora, s označenim merama",
    "The coffee unit fitted out in pale oak and zinc: wine racks at the far end, a chalkboard menu and the espresso machine at the hatch, with dimensions marked": "Kafe jedinica uređena u svetlom hrastu i cinku: stalci za vino u dnu, meni na tabli i espreso mašina kod prozora, s označenim merama",
    "The pale oak fit-out seen from the door: zinc counters down both sides, cups and a grinder to the right and a wine rack filling the end wall": "Uređenje u svetlom hrastu, pogled s vrata: cinkani pultovi s obe strane, šolje i mlin desno i stalak za vino preko celog zadnjeg zida",
    "Inside": "Unutra",
    "The room you work in": "Prostorija u kojoj radite",
    "Two of the pictures above are the same shell. One is a public house in dark green with a pew and a stove, the other is white boarding with a zinc bar. What does not change is the room, and the room is what decides whether a service works.": "Dve slike iznad pokazuju isti korpus. Jedna je pab u tamnozelenoj, s klupom i peći, druga je bela obloga s cinkanim šankom. Ono što se ne menja jeste prostorija, a prostorija odlučuje da li posluživanje radi.",
    "Counters down both sides, the machine at the hatch and the till by the door, so a barista turns rather than walks. The aisle between them is the figure that decides whether two people can work a queue without standing on each other.": "Pultovi s obe strane, mašina kod prozora i kasa kraj vrata, pa se barista okreće a ne hoda. Prolaz između njih je ona mera koja odlučuje da li dvoje ljudi mogu da rade red a da se ne sudaraju.",
    "Drawn for the 18 ft platform. The finish is yours to specify and every one of these pictures is a different brief; the shell, the aisle and the standing height are the same unit underneath. Confirmed against the manufacturer's drawing before an order is placed.": "Nacrtano za platformu od 18 ft. Obradu zadajete vi i svaka od ovih slika je drugi brif; korpus, prolaz i visina u punom rastu ispod njih su ista jedinica. Potvrđuje se prema crtežu proizvođača pre nego što se porudžbina preda.",
    "One shell, two briefs. Nothing structural differs between these two rooms: the chassis, the width, the aisle and the standing height are the same unit. What changes is everything a customer of yours will actually notice.": "Jedan korpus, dva brifa. Između ove dve prostorije nema nijedne konstruktivne razlike: šasija, širina, prolaz i visina u punom rastu su im isti. Menja se sve ono što će vaša mušterija zaista primetiti.",
    "Height at the ridge": "Visina u slemenu",
    "Height at the wall": "Visina uz zid",
    "Working aisle": "Radni prolaz",
    "Bar counter": "Šank",
    "Back bar": "Zadnji šank",
    "Bar stools": "Barske stolice",
    "Wall bench": "Zidna klupa",
    "Tables": "Stolovi",
    "Door": "Vrata",
